{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an alternate 1980s where North Korea won their war, Brooklyn lies in ruins. The streets are controlled by the Vires syndicate, operating under the facade of Vires Corporations. As a former detective whose brother was murdered while investigating Vires Corporations, you've made a fatal choice: injecting yourself with ISS, a deadly military-grade stimulant that grants superhuman abilities at the cost of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/4b54a6b4a8dea53eb9c30f0a4b18f374.poster.avif?t=1751127073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/4b54a6b4a8dea53eb9c30f0a4b18f374.webm?t=1751127073\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KEY FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 MASTER SUPERNATURAL MOVEMENT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, and slide  as you tear through urban battlegrounds. Your enhanced abilities make you unstoppable - if you can stay alive long enough to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 EXPLORE A FRACTURED CITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From neon-lit corporate towers to abandoned subway tunnels, every corner of this alternate Brooklyn tells a story of war, corruption, and resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/715cd9855637716be2b7124c54a8342c.poster.avif?t=1751127073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/715cd9855637716be2b7124c54a8342c.webm?t=1751127073\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 UNLEASH YOUR ARSENAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield an array of classic and experimental weapons, or use your bare fists to pummel your way through thug after thug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 UNCOVER THE TRUTH</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With guidance from a mysterious pyramid-shaped entity, dive deep into a conspiracy that blurs the lines between victim and villain, justice and revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/9a5d49489730426b4d111ddaa24fa805.poster.avif?t=1751127073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/9a5d49489730426b4d111ddaa24fa805.webm?t=1751127073\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 WISHLIST!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like what you see here, please feel free to WISHLIST now, Thanks so much!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3339570?t=1751127073","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751127073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/2073a271fec933cfbd9737ddb9dcead08556682e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751127073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/2073a271fec933cfbd9737ddb9dcead08556682e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751127073","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This fast-paced action game contains:\r\nCombat violence and gunplay with moderate blood effects\r\nThemes involving drug use (fictional performance-enhancing drugs)\r\nDark themes including revenge, corruption, and conspiracy\r\nReferences to murder and criminal organizations\r\nSome mild language and dark humor\r\nThemes of self-sacrifice (protagonist uses a dangerous drug that shortens lifespan)\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an alternate 1980s where North Korea won their war, Brooklyn lies in ruins. The streets are controlled by the Vires syndicate, operating under the facade of Vires Corporations. As a former detective whose brother was murdered while investigating Vires Corporations, you've made a fatal choice: injecting yourself with ISS, a deadly military-grade stimulant that grants superhuman abilities at the cost of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/4b54a6b4a8dea53eb9c30f0a4b18f374.poster.avif?t=1751127073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/4b54a6b4a8dea53eb9c30f0a4b18f374.webm?t=1751127073\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KEY FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 MASTER SUPERNATURAL MOVEMENT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, and slide  as you tear through urban battlegrounds. Your enhanced abilities make you unstoppable - if you can stay alive long enough to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 EXPLORE A FRACTURED CITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From neon-lit corporate towers to abandoned subway tunnels, every corner of this alternate Brooklyn tells a story of war, corruption, and resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/715cd9855637716be2b7124c54a8342c.poster.avif?t=1751127073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/715cd9855637716be2b7124c54a8342c.webm?t=1751127073\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 UNLEASH YOUR ARSENAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield an array of classic and experimental weapons, or use your bare fists to pummel your way through thug after thug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 UNCOVER THE TRUTH</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With guidance from a mysterious pyramid-shaped entity, dive deep into a conspiracy that blurs the lines between victim and villain, justice and revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/9a5d49489730426b4d111ddaa24fa805.poster.avif?t=1751127073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/9a5d49489730426b4d111ddaa24fa805.webm?t=1751127073\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 WISHLIST!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like what you see here, please feel free to WISHLIST now, Thanks so much!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Rubicon Game Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/header.jpg?t=1751127073","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 20